EXT. PACIFIC HIGHWAY - SPEED PURSUIT - DAY
[STYLE: Comic Book Ink | CAMERA: Low Angle Kinetic Hero]

A customized matte-black armored truck thunders along the cliffside coastal highway at 120 MPH.

JAX (20s, leather jacket, fingerless gloves) leaps his supercharged motorcycle onto the rear roof of the armored truck!

JAX
